#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.9"
msgstr "v3.6.9"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.9 brings **WiFi to the Arduino Portenta H7** — the LWIP networking "
"stack and Cypress CYW43 drivers were added and WiFi was enabled — along with"
" external-flash storage init and a batch of Portenta clock/memory and "
"networking stability fixes. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — "
"v3.6.8 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.9 为 **Arduino Portenta H7** 带来了 **WiFi** —— 新增了 LWIP 网络协议栈和 Cypress "
"CYW43 驱动并启用了 WiFi —— 同时还包括外部闪存存储初始化以及一批 Portenta 时钟/内存和网络稳定性修复。它\\ "
"**不引入任何破坏性 API 改动** —— v3.6.8 的脚本无需修改即可运行。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** — LWIP stack and Cypress CYW43 WiFi drivers added and "
"WiFi enabled, with a separate CYW43 firmware image shipped in the release."
msgstr ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** —— 新增了 LWIP 协议栈和 Cypress CYW43 WiFi 驱动并启用了 "
"WiFi，发行版中附带了一个独立的 CYW43 固件镜像。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:22
msgid ""
"**External-flash storage** — storage is now initialized on boards with "
"external flash, plus a memory-mapped external-flash region."
msgstr "**外部闪存存储** —— 现在会在带有外部闪存的开发板上初始化存储，并新增了一个内存映射的外部闪存区域。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Stability** — Portenta clock/memory (FMC/SDRAM, QSPI, PLL1) and networking"
" init/de-init fixes."
msgstr "**稳定性** —— Portenta 时钟/内存（FMC/SDRAM、QSPI、PLL1）以及网络初始化/反初始化修复。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:26
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.6.8 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "**无破坏性 API 改动** —— 重新刷写固件后，你的 v3.6.8 脚本无需修改即可运行。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:30
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** — added the LWIP library and CYW43 drivers (LWIP and "
"CYW43 submodules), enabled WiFi on the Portenta, generated a separate CYW43 "
"firmware image, and added the CYW4343 firmware binary to the release "
"deliverables."
msgstr ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** —— 新增了 LWIP 库和 CYW43 驱动（LWIP 与 CYW43 子模块），在 Portenta "
"上启用了 WiFi，生成了一个独立的 CYW43 固件镜像，并将 CYW4343 固件二进制文件加入了发行交付物。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:36
msgid ""
"**External flash** — storage is now initialized on boards with external "
"flash, with a configurable linker section for the CYW43 firmware and a "
"memory-mapped external-flash region."
msgstr ""
"**外部闪存** —— 现在会在带有外部闪存的开发板上初始化存储，并为 CYW43 固件提供了一个可配置的链接器段以及一个内存映射的外部闪存区域。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:41
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他改动与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:43
msgid ""
"Used the highest-priority MPU region for DMA buffers and added the CYW43 / "
"LWIP initialization paths in ``main``."
msgstr "为 DMA 缓冲区使用了最高优先级的 MPU 区域，并在 ``main`` 中新增了 CYW43 / LWIP 初始化路径。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:47
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "错误修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:49
msgid "Portenta and memory:"
msgstr "Portenta 与内存："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:51
msgid ""
"Fixed the Portenta FMC/SDRAM and QSPI PLL settings, the QSPI prescaler, the "
"QSPI MPU config, and PLL1."
msgstr "修复了 Portenta 的 FMC/SDRAM 和 QSPI PLL 设置、QSPI 预分频器、QSPI MPU 配置以及 PLL1。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:54
msgid "Networking and system:"
msgstr "网络与系统："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:56
msgid ""
"Fixed the WiFi initialization functions, added the missing LWIP/CYW43 "
"initialization in ``main``, called network de-init in ``main``, fixed SDIO "
"DMA transfers, the USBDBG IRQn bug, and de-init the I2C bus before re-"
"initializing it."
msgstr ""
"修复了 WiFi 初始化函数，在 ``main`` 中补充了缺失的 LWIP/CYW43 初始化，在 ``main`` 中调用了网络反初始化，修复了 "
"SDIO DMA 传输、USBDBG IRQn 错误，并在重新初始化 I2C 总线之前先对其进行反初始化。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:62
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与开发板支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — WiFi (CYW43 / LWIP) and external-flash storage."
msgstr "**Arduino Portenta H7** —— WiFi（CYW43 / LWIP）以及外部闪存存储。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:67
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 改动"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:69
msgid ""
"v3.6.9 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.6.8 run unchanged on v3.6.9 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.9 **不引入任何破坏性 Python API 改动**\\ 。在 v3.6.8 上运行的脚本在 v3.6.9 上无需修改即可运行 —— "
"只需重新刷写固件即可。"
